  triage:title "--source timeline/merged silently drop --since and all but the first --level value" ;
  triage:description "qa-pr1182-r1 (msg 01M1QSQWFKBENPSW4ZP83SKMYS) at 199a3bfeb: req-qa ATM-QA-103 and RBQA-F002 (important): DiagnosticQuery is built with since: None, until: None and only self.levels.first() is honored. sprint-AW.3 D2 requires --since, --level (all values) and --limit to apply to every source. Fix: thread --since/--until and the full level set through DiagnosticQuery for timeline and merged modes." ;
